var e=[{id:`tut_call_1`,type:`calls`,step:1,title:`The Classic`,text:`The phone rings shrilly. A user complains at volume that his 'internet has been deleted', because the blue E is missing from his desktop. Your ticket counter keeps ticking on, mercilessly.`,opts:[{t:`Breathe deeply and create a shortcut.`,m:15,l:5,a:15,b:0,r:`You have spent valuable hours of your life on this. The ticket, however, is closed. The sheer stupidity of the request has put your pulse up noticeably all the same.`},{t:`Tell him the internet is shut today for maintenance.`,m:5,l:0,a:30,b:10,r:`The user is confused, but calm. That was quick! Your pulse climbs sharply nonetheless, because you know that sentence is going to have consequences.`}]},{id:`tut_coffee_1`,type:`coffee`,step:4,title:`Black Gold`,text:`You stand in front of the machine in the break room. The brew smells of scorched earth and despair, but it is your only chance of getting your pulse back under 180.`,opts:[{t:`Shut your eyes and get it down.`,m:5,l:0,a:-15,b:5,r:`Your stomach cramps briefly, but the urge to murder your last caller subsides noticeably. The system registers your absence.`},{t:`Have a good long moan to colleagues while you drink.`,m:20,l:15,a:-25,b:0,r:`The impromptu therapy session helped. The system, however, files the extended chat under refusal to work in its most cultivated form.`}]},{id:`tut_sq_1`,type:`sidequest`,step:5,title:`The Deserted Kitchen`,text:`You slip into the kitchenette. Somebody has left half a box of doughnuts standing about. A colleague is coming closer.`,opts:[{t:`Grab a doughnut quickly and vanish.`,m:5,l:5,a:0,b:5,loot:`donut`,r:`You have secured yourself a doughnut, though you did get a slightly odd look for it.`},{t:`Draw the colleague into conversation and help yourself quietly.`,m:10,l:10,a:0,b:0,loot:`donut`,r:`The conversation was excruciatingly dull, but the doughnut is yours!`}]},{id:`tut_srv_1`,type:`server`,step:6,title:`The Sanctuary`,text:`The thick security door falls shut behind you. The constant, loud rush of the fans drowns out the lamenting of the users. It is freezing, dark and absolutely peaceful.`,opts:[{t:`Enjoy the holy quiet and breathe.`,m:15,l:15,a:-20,b:0,r:`You lean against a 19-inch rack and feel your blood pressure sinking. The relief is glorious, but your laziness metric shoots up.`},{t:`Rummage through the odds-and-ends box for hardware.`,m:10,l:0,a:0,b:0,loot:`wifi_note`,r:`You find a well-thumbed Wi-Fi note. Could come in handy for bribing other departments later.`}]}];export{e as tutorial};